
 >> x := Wanta haaraa.
 >> y := Wanta haaraa.
 >> z := x.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x isuma-tokko: y ), dhaabi.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x isuma-tokko: z ), dhaabi.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x = y ), dhaabi.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x = z ), dhaabi.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x ≠ y ), dhaabi.
 Baʼii barreessi: ( x ≠ z ), dhaabi.
 